{"name":"The Universe Bell","slug":"glyph-universe-bell","blurb":"On the depth street, Arlo carries the bell toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Universe. Click the bell and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Universe Bell.","seal":"a7882ce635e026aa4c47486c6ff1307eb2b615a0079cc8732b144a3a32a90770"}
